      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's understandable to feel overwhelmed when you see negative patterns in your life, especially when they impact the people you cherish. But leaving might not only stop the spread; it could also be a crucial step in creating a different future for yourself and those who come after you. It's a kind gesture toward yourself and others. Please consider reaching out to a professional who can guide you through these feelings and help you find healthier ways to cope. You may also feel empowered looking into support groups where you're among those who feel similarly. You're not alone in this, and there is always a way to break free from painful patterns.",
      "source": "target",
