      "content": "It is a heart-wrenching thing to see the struggle, but ending the cycle hasn't to be an act of failure; it's a profoundly brave, compassionate choice. Yet, even in the midst of this choice, it's possible to establish a new legacy for yourself. A legacy where you inspire others with your courage, even if it's in a different way than you've experienced. Your story isn't solely about the struggle, but about finding the strength to do what's in your best interest—even if that means self-preservation. Remember, your love for others doesn't end with them; it also respects your future wellbeing. It's important to acknowledge your feelings, and honoring them doesn't necessarily mean throwing your hands up in surrender. There's often hope on the horizon and paths forward, even if they're not immediately clear. If you're open to it, I can help you explore or create these pathways together.",
      "source": "target",
